rough undergrowth) 6) Resist Death's Touch (+4 on saves vs death effects, energy drain, necromancy effects, + stabilization checks) 7) Wild Shape (turn into animal, 2/day) 8) Many Lives (Reincarnate) 9) Cheat Death (reroll death effect/energy drain/necromancy effect at 9th) 10) A Thousand Faces (13th level, change appearance at will) 11) Tongue of Sun/Moon (15th level, speak with any living creature).","classFeatures":"CLASS FEATURES: 1) Nature Bond (Animal Companion) 2) Nature Sense (+2 Knowledge Nature and Survival) 3) Wild Empathy (improve attitude of an animal) 4) Mysterious Stranger (+1/2 level to DC for Sense Motive, Diplomacy, Knowledge checks) 5) Trackless Step (move normal speed through undergrowth) 6) Resist Death's Touch (+4 on saves vs death effects, energy drain, necromancy effects, + stabilization checks) 7) Wild Shape (turn into animal, 2/day) 8) Many Lives (Reincarnate) 9) Cheat Death (reroll death effect/energy drain/necromancy effect at 9th) 10) A Thousand Faces (13th level, change appearance at will) 11) Tongue of Sun/Moon (15th level, speak with any living creature).","racialTraits":"","characterNotes":"WILD SHAPE FORMS:\n- Large animal (+4 Str, -2 Dex, +4 natural armor): dire bear form used (+19/+4 swim, scent) - owl 2 claws +9 (2d6+6)\n- Small animal (+4 Dex, +2 natural armor): eagle\n- Tiny animal (-2 Str, +8 Dex size, +3 natural armor)\n- Water elemental (small): +2 Con, +4 natural armor, breathe underwater, create vortex\n- Air elemental: +2 Dex, +2 natural armor, fly 60 ft, whirlwind ability (Reflex DC 10 + 1/2 monster HD + Str mod or take slam damage; second Reflex save or be picked up and carried; -4 Dex/-2 attack while inside; Con check DC 15 + spell level to cast while whirlwinding; touching ground kicks up obscuring debris cloud)\n\nANIMAL COMPANION / SUMMONS:\n- Grizzly Bear (level 4 companion): Large, AC 16/touch 10/flat-footed 15, Fort +8 Ref +5 Will +2, Str 21 Dex 13 Con 19 Int 2 Wis 12 Cha 6, BAB +3, CMB +9 (+13 grapple), CMD 20. Feats: Endurance, Run, Skill Focus (Survival). Perception +6, Survival +5, Swim +14.\n- Crocodile (level 2 companion) - stats not fully recorded\n- LEVEL 5 CYCLOPS 100% CRIT\n\n\n-I WAS AN ELF FOR 380 YEARS died of old age.","worldNotes":""},"casters":[{"className":"Reincarnated Druid","ability":"wis","prog":"full","clOverride":null}],"spellsPrepared":[{"level":0,"name":"Guidance","school":"Divination","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Stabilize","school":"Conjuration","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Create Water","school":"Conjuration","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Resistance","school":"Abjuration","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Spark","school":"Evocation","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Read Magic","school":"Divination","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Mending","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Chameleon Scales","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":0,"name":"Enhanced Diplomacy","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":1,"name":"Entangle","school":"Transmutation","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Goodberry","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Longstrider","school":"Transmutation","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Touch of the Sea","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":1,"name":"Obscuring Mist","school":"Conjuration","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Cure Light Wounds","school":"Conjuration","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Feather Step","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":1,"name":"Frostbite","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":1,"name":"Gentle Repose","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":1,"name":"Ice Armor","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Faerie Fire","school":"Evocation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":1,"name":"Mudball","school":"Conjugation -Standard action","prepared":true,"used":false,"notes":"Range close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)\nEffect single fist-sized blob of sticky mud\nDuration instantaneous\nSaving Throw Reflex negates; see text; Spell Resistance no\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\nWhen you cast this spell, you conjure a single ball of sticky mud and launch it at an enemy’s face as a ranged touch attack. If the mudball hits, the target is blinded. Each round at the beginning of its turn, a creature blinded by this spell can attempt a Reflex saving throw to shake off the mud, ending the effect. The mudball can also be wiped off by the creature affected by it or by a creature adjacent to the creature affected by it as a standard action.","manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":"Range close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)\nEffect single fist-sized blob of sticky mud\nDuration instantaneous\nSaving Throw Reflex negates; see text; Spell Resistance no\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\nWhen you cast this spell, you conjure a single ball of sticky mud and launch it at an enemy’s face as a ranged touch attack. If the mudball hits, the target is blinded. Each round at the beginning of its turn, a creature blinded by this spell can attempt a Reflex saving throw to shake off the mud, ending the effect. The mudball can also be wiped off by the creature affected by it or by a creature adjacent to the creature affected by it as a standard action."}},{"level":2,"name":"Flaming Sphere","school":"Conjuration","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Barkskin","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Owl's Wisdom","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Aggressive Thundercloud","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Tree Shape","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Resist Energy","school":"Abjuration","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Vine Strike","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":2,"name":"Divine Trident","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":2,"name":"Eagle Eye","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Wood Shape","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Restoration, Lesser","school":"Conjuration","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":2,"name":"Aspect of the Bear","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"Personal","target":"","duration":"1 min per level ","save":"","sr":"","desc":"You take on an aspect of a bear. You gain a +2 enhancement bonus to natural armor and a +2 enhancement bonus on CMB rolls. You can also perform bull rush, grapple, and overrun combat maneuvers without provoking attacks of opportunity."}},{"level":2,"name":"Whip of Spiders","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":2,"name":"Hold Animal","school":"Enchantment","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Call Lightning","school":"Evocation","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Cure Moderate Wounds","school":"Conjuration","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Plant Growth","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Spike Growth","school":"Transmutation","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Stone Shape","school":"Transmutation","prepared":false,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Steal Size","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Ice Spears","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"25ft+ 5/2 lvl.","target":"","duration":"instant 2 spears","save":"Reflex Half","sr":"no","desc":"Upon casting this spell, one or more giant spears of ice lance up out of the ground. Each stalagmite-like icicle affects a 5-foot square and tapers to a height of 10 feet. You may cause a number of ice spears equal to one spear for every four caster levels you possess to burst from the ground. A creature that occupies a square from which a spear extends (or that is within 10 feet of the ground below) takes 2d6 points of piercing damage and 2d6 points of cold damage per square—creatures that take up more than one square can be hit by multiple spears if the caster is high enough level. The explosive growth can also trip foes. When the spears erupt from the ground, they make a combat maneuver check against any targets that take damage from the spears, with a total bonus equal to your caster level plus your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma modifier, whichever is highest. Each additional ice spear beyond the first that strikes a single foe grants a +10 bonus to this CMB check. If the check succeeds, the ice spears knock the foe prone. A successful Reflex save halves the damage and prevents the trip attempt.\n\nIf you cast this spell upon an area covered with ice or snow, such as atop a glacier, frozen lake, or snow-covered field, the spears strike with additional force. Saves against the effect suffer a –2 penalty and the spell gains a +4 bonus on its combat maneuver check to trip foes. Ice spears created by this spell remain after they do their damage. They melt as normal depending on the surrounding environment. They no longer damage foes in their square, but can provide cover. An ice spear has hardness 5 and 30 hit points."}},{"level":3,"name":"Vengeful Comets","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":3,"name":"Sky Swim","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Hydrophobia","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Aversion","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Companion Mind","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Bleed for Your Master","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Apport Animal","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":3,"name":"Burst of Nettles","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":4,"name":"Aggressive Thundercloud, Greater","school":"","prepared":true,"used":false},{"level":4,"name":"Animal Ambassador","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":4,"name":"Bountiful Banquet","school":"","prepared":false,"used":false,"manual":{"ct":"","comp":"","range":"","target":"","duration":"","save":"","sr":"","desc":""}},{"level":4,"name":"Cure Serious Wounds",